            "sid": "JER 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, akoba ati: “Olunaku olwo bwe lulituuka ndimenhamenha ebikoligo ebiri mu nkoto dhaibwe, era naakutulakutula n'endhegere dhe baabasiba. Tibaliiramu kabiri kuba bairu ba bamaghanga gandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye baidha kumpeerezanga, nze Musengwa Katonda waibwe, era bagheerezenga ni mwidhukulu wa Daudi ye ndibateeragho okuba kyabazinga waibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
